                            jcr:title="Great Places to Work 2026"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                            langAttribute="none"
                            type="h5"
                            variant="h"/>
                        <text
                            cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                            jcr:created="{Date}2024-08-01T01:47:24.434-04:00"
                            jcr:createdBy="singarx"
                            jcr:lastModified="{Date}2026-03-11T02:26:03.501-04:00"
                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="singarx"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            langAttribute="none"
                            text="&lt;p>AbbVie was recognised as one of the Best Super Large Workplaces in Ireland at the 24th annual Great Place to Work 2026 Awards – ranking 3rd. 2026 marked the 13th consecutive year that the company has featured on the list, making AbbVie the highest placed company in the biopharmaceutical/pharmaceutical industry across all categories.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>The organisation publishes five lists at its annual awards, with AbbVie joining 20 other companies among Ireland’s Best Super Large Workplaces (more than 550 employees). Additionally, AbbVie was named one of the Best Workplaces for Women for the eighth year in a row.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                            textIsRich="true"/>
                        <separator
