                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            langAttribute="none"
                            text="&lt;p>‌AbbVie won two major categories at the Pharma Industry Awards Ireland 2025, winning “Pharma Company of the Year (Large)” and “Biopharma Company of the Year.”&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>The awards celebrate innovation, business excellence and societal impact and recognise the combined effort of all six AbbVie sites in Ireland.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
