                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="singarx"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            langAttribute="none"
                            text="&lt;p>AbbVie’s commitment to fostering and advancing early career talent was recognised at the&amp;nbsp;&lt;i>gradireland&lt;/i>&amp;nbsp;Graduate Recruitment Awards 2025. The graduate organisation presented AbbVie with three trophies, including a gold award for ‘Best Internship Program’ (&amp;lt;50 intake) at the event.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>‌The awards celebrate excellence in graduate recruitment and development in Ireland across a number of key sectors.&amp;nbsp;&lt;i>gradireland&lt;/i>&amp;nbsp;is the leading careers platform for students and graduates in Ireland, and the annual awards attract submissions from some of Ireland’s leading companies and organisations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                            textIsRich="true"/>
